Show me your ID
- Show ID | [if {has_id} == true] [else="disable"]
	Alright, you can go in.
	[signal arg="corridor_unlocked"]
- Show Office Pass | [if {has_pass} == true] [else="disable"]
	Oh, so you here for an interview. Please head right in.
	[signal arg="corridor_unlocked"]
- (Lie) I'm here to check on the data server
	Oh sure, its right behind the security door at the end of the corridor.
- I don't have one
	I can't allow unauthorized people inside
